Native vector animation extension for pdfpc

The default native source is https://github.com/ojura/pdfpc.
revision.txt pins its source revision; a project may explicitly select another
compatible repository and full revision in presentations.json.
The fork builds on pdfpc v4.7.0 from https://github.com/pdfpc/pdfpc.
pdfpc, its vector implementation and these integration helpers are distributed
under GPL-3.0-or-later. Upstream copyright notices remain in the fork's sources.
The accompanying LICENSE is the GNU General Public License version 3.

The fork adds native Cairo path rendering to pdfpc's GTK drawing areas.
Manim supplies the vector geometry, style keyframes and semantic checkpoints.
The standard PDF is still independently readable; its linked poster rectangle
identifies where pdfpc draws the corresponding scene.

Upstream dependency and compilation documentation:
https://github.com/pdfpc/pdfpc/tree/v4.7.0#compilation-from-sources

Ubuntu development packages:
cmake ninja-build valac libgee-0.8-dev libpoppler-glib-dev libgtk-3-dev
libjson-glib-dev librsvg2-dev libgirepository1.0-dev
